cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use KINTSUGI, please cite the STAR Protocols article below
  (preferred-citation) and, where appropriate, the software release.
type: software
title: "KINTSUGI: Knowledge Integration with New Technologies for Simplified User-Guided Image processing"
abstract: >-
  Multiplex immunofluorescence image processing pipeline (illumination correction,
  stitching, deconvolution, extended depth of focus, multi-cycle registration,
  autofluorescence removal, segmentation and spatial analysis) with a Model
  Context Protocol (MCP) server for Claude Code.
version: 1.2.3
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/smith6jt-cop/KINTSUGI"
